@startuml
' What `hide`, `show`, `remove` and `restore` leave of a class diagram,
' and the lines up into one parent under `groupInheritance`.
skinparam groupInheritance 2
hide empty members
hide circle
hide <<Serializable>> stereotype
hide private members
show Account fields
class Usuario {
  -id : int
  +name : String
  +login()
}
class Cliente
class Empleado
class Admin
class Account <<Serializable>> {
  -balance : int
  +open()
}
class Draft $wip
class Archive $wip
class Ghost
Usuario <|-- Cliente
Usuario <|-- Empleado
Usuario <|-- Admin
Usuario "1" -- "0..*" Usuario : supervisa >
Cliente --> Account
Account --> Ghost
hide Ghost
remove @unlinked
restore Archive
@enduml
